4. Added the team and platformClientId to the calEvent data to ensure the manage link is displayed
5. Made sure the attendee email matches one in the team members to grant access to the management options

The translation function is now properly structured within the attendee's language property as expected by the ManageLink component. This should resolve the "t is not a function" error.

